@startuml
!include _astyle.iuml
title 5.3  Parts Procurement and Verification (QP.14) — Activity
|Technologist|
start
:Raise Internal Demand (F212);
|WoS / HOD|
:Verify & approve; forward to Stores;
|Stores|
:Perform stock check (F244);
if (Stock available?) then (yes)
  :Issue via F213 to holding unit;
else (NIL stock)
  :Forward F213 to Purchasing;
  |Purchasing|
  :Request for Quotation (F220, <=2 days);
  :Evaluate (F221); select supplier (min 3);
  :Issue Purchase Order (F312);
  |Supplier|
  :Submit proforma invoice;
  |Finance|
  :Arrange payment;
  |Supplier|
  :Deliver part;
  |Stores|
  :Receipt inspection (QP.15);
  if (Discrepancy?) then (yes)
    :Raise Stores Discrepancy Report (F217);
  else (no)
  endif
endif
|Stores|
:Issue part to originator (F212);
stop
@enduml
